      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not explicitly state that the morpheme/label “mon-” by itself refers to the monitoring control condition; it only describes a “monitoring control group” labeled “CB-Mon,” so the mapping “mon- → monitoring control condition” is not directly supported.",
        "While the packet supports that the monitoring control group maintains usual cannabis use and is compared with an abstinence condition, it does not clearly support the phrasing that participants “continue their usual cannabis use while being observed or assessed” as a defining feature of “mon-” (assessment is mentioned generally via EMA phases, not specifically as the meaning of the “mon-” term)."
